# Keep the project's own line endings: every file here is written with LF (the app parses fine either way,
# but a checkout that rewrote them all as CRLF would show the whole project as changed in the first diff).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Things that must stay byte-for-byte: a png has no line endings, and a bat file needs its own.
*.png binary
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.exe binary
